{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34276","headline":"吴俞儿舞歌 弩俞 · 陆龟蒙","name":"吴俞儿舞歌 弩俞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牛来开弦，人爲置镞。\n捩机关，迸山谷。\n鹿骇涩，隼击迟。\n析毫中睫，洞腋分龟。\n达坚垒，残雄师。\n可以冠猛乐壮曲，抑扬蹈厉。\n有裂犀兕之气者，非公与。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}